WEBVTT

00:00:00.560 --> 00:00:03.480
I'm gonna be the first-star idol one day!

00:00:03.480 --> 00:00:07.570
Nijino Yume's Aikatsu is about to start!

00:00:09.530 --> 00:00:16.700
Over the next four days, we will hold the crowning event of the year, the S4 Selection.

00:00:24.830 --> 00:00:26.830
Tomorrow is Theater Class.

00:00:32.630 --> 00:00:36.220
Every aspect of being an idol will be judged in this competition.{this honestly confuses me}

00:00:36.970 --> 00:00:43.480
The final scores will be determined by the judges' ratings and the audience's votes.

00:00:43.480 --> 00:00:51.360
Whoever earns the most points will be crowned top of their class and earn a spot in S4.

00:01:10.290 --> 00:01:14.300
Every idol in Dance Class has had their chance!

00:01:14.300 --> 00:01:18.050
Now then, who shined the brightest?{caly would be mad}

00:02:53.520 --> 00:02:57.490
It's time to announce Nikaidou Yuzu's score!

00:03:04.490 --> 00:03:06.330
The top of Dance Class is...

00:03:08.120 --> 00:03:10.080
Nikaidou Yuzu!

00:03:10.080 --> 00:03:13.630
I did it! Thanks, everyone!

00:03:13.630 --> 00:03:16.380
The top of Dance Class is Nikaidou Yuzu!

00:03:16.380 --> 00:03:20.010
She's earned a spot in S4 for the second year in a row!

00:03:21.010 --> 00:03:22.720
I knew Yuzu-senpai would do it!

00:03:22.720 --> 00:03:25.220
Yeah, it was a runaway victory.{what is this unprovoked japanish}{it's regular english!}

00:03:25.220 --> 00:03:28.770
It's amazing she's going to represent 
Dance Class in S4 two years running.

00:03:28.770 --> 00:03:35.980
Even if Hime-senpai, Tsubasa-senpai, or Onee-chan win, 
they'll be graduating at the end of the year,

00:03:35.980 --> 00:03:38.780
so whoever takes second will join S4.

00:03:38.780 --> 00:03:42.820
That may be true, but coming in second would be unacceptable.

00:03:42.820 --> 00:03:49.790
Elegantly besting the current S4 to take their thrones would be far more dramatic.

00:03:49.790 --> 00:03:51.160
I think so too.

00:03:51.160 --> 00:03:55.670
Naturally, I won't accept anything less than beating Onee-chan to take her place.

00:03:55.670 --> 00:04:01.170
But most importantly, this is our last chance to compete with the third-years on the same stage.

00:04:01.170 --> 00:04:03.930
Yeah, we can't let it go to waste.

00:04:03.930 --> 00:04:07.640
Tomorrow is your long-awaited Theater Class S4 Selection.

00:04:07.640 --> 00:04:09.520
Good luck, Ako-chan.

00:04:09.520 --> 00:04:14.900
There's no need for that. I will claim my spot at the top of Theater Class in S4.

00:04:18.150 --> 00:04:20.030
Yuzu, congratulations!

00:04:20.030 --> 00:04:23.530
Thanks, Lilienne. You were waiting for me?

00:04:23.530 --> 00:04:24.490
Yes.

00:04:25.620 --> 00:04:28.620
I got to have a super fun time dancing today.

00:04:29.910 --> 00:04:36.540
To tend, unfailingly, unflinchingly, towards a goal, is the secret of success. {um, it's either this, or the following: Success depends in a very large measure upon individual initiative 
and exertion, and cannot be achieved except by a dint of hard work.}{let's.. with this one}

00:04:36.540 --> 00:04:40.920
Watching you brought to mind the words of a prima ballerina.

00:04:40.920 --> 00:04:43.340
Oh, thanks for the proverb. {I looked at some options but just gonna stick with what we had}

00:04:44.300 --> 00:04:48.100
I want to share the stage of S4 with you.

00:04:48.100 --> 00:04:50.560
So you'd better become the top of Song Class.

00:04:51.430 --> 00:04:53.770
I am of the same mind.

00:04:55.690 --> 00:04:57.980
Yuzu blew the field away.

00:04:57.980 --> 00:05:03.690
Honestly, she let the whole of her ability flow out and envelop the competition.

00:05:03.690 --> 00:05:06.530
It was a uniquely Yuzu performance.

00:05:06.530 --> 00:05:14.210
The most critical time to demonstrate our full power is on our way out, just as our predecessors did.

00:05:14.210 --> 00:05:19.460
Yeah, otherwise we would belittle the earnest efforts of our hardworking protégés.

00:05:19.460 --> 00:05:21.460
We need to face them seriously.

00:05:21.460 --> 00:05:25.260
Yes, that's our duty as S4.

00:05:25.260 --> 00:05:26.090
Right.

00:05:26.090 --> 00:05:29.600
Hey! I won!

00:05:30.300 --> 00:05:31.600
Oh, Yuzu.

00:05:31.600 --> 00:05:33.640
Praise me more!

00:05:33.640 --> 00:05:35.690
You held a lovely performance.

00:05:35.690 --> 00:05:39.020
We can rest easy with next year's S4 in your capable hands.

00:05:39.020 --> 00:05:40.980
Yeah, take good care of them.

00:05:40.980 --> 00:05:42.900
Leave it all to me!

00:05:45.490 --> 00:05:48.240
Yes, for I am an actress!

00:05:48.240 --> 00:05:53.620
I exist to bloom brilliantly as a rose, to fly gracefully as a swan!

00:05:53.620 --> 00:05:58.000
Now, let my heart fill with pride, so that I may take the stage!

00:06:05.720 --> 00:06:11.390
Subaru-kyun, sweet farewells, for we must not meet until I achieve victory in the S4 Selection.

00:06:12.470 --> 00:06:15.020
"What? You're making me feel lonely already."

00:06:15.020 --> 00:06:18.440
Forgive me, but I must seal my passion for you away.

00:06:18.440 --> 00:06:23.020
Now is the time for me to devote myself to reaching my dream!

00:06:23.020 --> 00:06:25.530
"I see. You've got it.

00:06:25.530 --> 00:06:30.030
I'll be cheering for you from inside this box."

00:06:30.030 --> 00:06:35.120
Thank you. Your support means more to me than anything in the world.

00:06:35.120 --> 00:06:40.540
Now, I must steel my heart and part with my beloved Subaru-kyun!

00:06:42.080 --> 00:06:46.300
That's easy to say, but I still feel restless here stuck in my room.

00:06:46.300 --> 00:06:48.630
I should exercise this energy away.

00:06:51.470 --> 00:06:56.890
I do not want to lose to anyone. No matter what, 
I will prove that the top spot and S4 belong to me.

00:06:57.980 --> 00:07:03.310
Well, it's one thing to act confident in front of the girls,

00:07:03.310 --> 00:07:07.530
but I truly can't imagine beating Tsubasa-senpai.

00:07:08.070 --> 00:07:12.870
Does she have any sort of weakness that I can take advantage of?

00:07:12.870 --> 00:07:16.120
This calls for a full scan of my mental database.

00:07:16.120 --> 00:07:18.120
Tick tick tick tick...

00:07:18.120 --> 00:07:22.000
Huh? Tick tick tick tick...

00:07:22.000 --> 00:07:25.250
Nothing! There's nothing!

00:07:25.250 --> 00:07:29.090
Tsubasa-senpai really is perfectly flawless...

00:07:29.090 --> 00:07:30.970
What's going on, Saotome?

00:07:31.800 --> 00:07:33.720
Perfectly Flawless-senpai!

00:07:37.260 --> 00:07:39.480
Tomorrow's the day.

00:07:39.480 --> 00:07:40.520
Yes.

00:07:40.520 --> 00:07:43.440
This will be my last S4 Selection.

00:07:44.270 --> 00:07:45.770
Senpai.

00:07:45.770 --> 00:07:49.820
I will not accept anything less than joining S4.

00:07:49.820 --> 00:07:51.450
I'm sure you'll make it.

00:07:52.320 --> 00:07:54.450
You have the skills.

00:07:55.570 --> 00:07:57.330
That isn't all.

00:07:58.450 --> 00:08:02.750
I want to defeat you and claim the top position.

00:08:03.710 --> 00:08:05.250
That's the spirit.

00:08:05.250 --> 00:08:11.090
I'll be putting everything I have on the table, so come at me with all you've got.

00:08:11.970 --> 00:08:16.720
Understood! Tomorrow I will show you my greatest performance yet!

00:08:16.720 --> 00:08:18.390
I'm looking forward to it.

00:08:18.390 --> 00:08:19.180
Me too.

00:08:25.730 --> 00:08:28.320
Save that for after our battle.

00:09:01.890 --> 00:09:06.060
<i>Koharu-chan, it's almost time for Song Class's S4 Selection. {I want to say something, but I'll keep it to myself for now}</i>

00:09:08.770 --> 00:09:14.280
<i>I'll be competing with Rola, Hime-senpai, and the others for a spot in S4.</i>

00:09:14.820 --> 00:09:16.780
<i>My dream is to make it into S4.</i>

00:09:17.660 --> 00:09:19.370
<i>I need you to believe in me.</i>

00:09:32.460 --> 00:09:34.010
The Day Safari Coord.

00:09:41.060 --> 00:09:44.560
This will be my battle dress.

00:09:47.190 --> 00:09:50.900
On the second day of the S4 Selection, we have Theater Class.

00:09:50.900 --> 00:09:56.240
Underclassmen and third-years will draw lots separately to determine their order. {the way he says ichi-ninensei to sannensei is weirding me out. does he mean all separate, or 1+2 and 3}{1+2 and 3}

00:09:56.240 --> 00:10:00.070
Kisaragi Tsubasa of S4 will go at the end.

00:10:02.030 --> 00:10:04.790
Yes, for I am an actress!

00:10:04.790 --> 00:10:10.420
I exist to bloom brilliantly as a rose, to fly gracefully as a swan!

00:10:10.420 --> 00:10:15.130
Now, let my heart fill with pride, so that I may take the stage!

00:10:17.720 --> 00:10:20.930
<i>Saotome, you've grown.</i>

00:10:26.100 --> 00:10:28.520
The will to ensure that kindness lives on...

00:10:28.520 --> 00:10:32.440
Yes, that is the true meaning of strength!

00:10:34.570 --> 00:10:37.700
<i>Senpai, you're breathtaking.</i>

00:10:41.910 --> 00:10:43.990
We now proceed to the concert portion. {kind of hard to use most other words when acting is also a stage performance}

00:10:45.580 --> 00:10:48.500
Being myself is what's most important.

00:10:48.500 --> 00:10:50.960
Focus, focus...

00:10:50.960 --> 00:10:53.250
<i>Fear not, Saotome Ako!</i>

00:10:53.250 --> 00:10:56.550
<i>What's the point of thinking you'll lose before taking the stage?</i>

00:10:56.550 --> 00:10:58.510
<i>Come on, it's time.</i>

00:11:06.470 --> 00:11:09.440
<i>Saotome, try to snatch it away from me.</i>

00:11:09.440 --> 00:11:11.690
<i>Senpai, I won't lose.</i>

00:11:14.060 --> 00:11:17.690
<i>All I need to do is perform as usual.</i>

00:11:17.690 --> 00:11:20.950
<i>If I can do that, results will follow.</i>

00:11:22.030 --> 00:11:25.200
Saotome Ako, making a dazzling entrance!

00:14:35.390 --> 00:14:37.600
Her concentration was amazing!

00:14:37.600 --> 00:14:41.020
Ako felt a hundred times more powerful than usual.

00:14:41.020 --> 00:14:46.030
Yeah, I could feel her passion resonate inside me.

00:14:46.030 --> 00:14:48.900
Where does that place Saotome Ako?

00:14:59.960 --> 00:15:03.130
She has passed Sakamoto Arisa and slid into the top spot.

00:15:04.670 --> 00:15:06.380
Ako-chan did it!

00:15:06.380 --> 00:15:09.720
Wow, that's an impressive gap.

00:15:09.720 --> 00:15:11.680
Only Tsubasa-senpai is left.

00:15:11.680 --> 00:15:15.930
<i>I have nothing left to give. 
Let the cards fall where they may.</i>

00:15:17.390 --> 00:15:20.060
<i>Saotome, that was splendid.</i>

00:15:20.730 --> 00:15:24.310
<i>This will be my final performance as the leader of Theater Class.</i>

00:15:24.310 --> 00:15:27.070
<i>Here goes everything, leaving no regrets.</i>

00:15:27.820 --> 00:15:30.650
Kisaragi Tsubasa, holding nothing back!

00:17:31.400 --> 00:17:32.610
Whoa...

00:17:32.610 --> 00:17:35.570
That's the power of an unquestioned queen of S4.

00:17:35.570 --> 00:17:37.910
But that's what we must overcome.

00:17:37.910 --> 00:17:40.830
Tsubasacchi reached a new level.

00:17:40.830 --> 00:17:43.410
What a stunning performance.

00:17:43.410 --> 00:17:46.790
Yes, I could feel her resolve. {I meant to say that}

00:17:46.790 --> 00:17:50.750
Every idol in Theater Class has now had her turn.

00:17:50.750 --> 00:17:53.050
Let us witness the top idol of Theater Class!

00:18:08.230 --> 00:18:11.820
Kisaragi Tsubasa is the top of Theater Class!

00:18:18.950 --> 00:18:21.530
I'm honored to have earned the top position.

00:18:21.530 --> 00:18:28.670
The lessons I learned at Four Star Academy and the time I devoted to S4 are my irreplaceable treasures.

00:18:29.210 --> 00:18:33.340
I will hold them dear as I venture forth into my future Aikatsu!

00:18:36.260 --> 00:18:37.800
<i>I couldn't win.</i>

00:18:45.470 --> 00:18:48.230
I hope Ako's not too down on herself.

00:18:48.230 --> 00:18:52.110
She did lose, but it was a performance she could be proud of.

00:18:52.110 --> 00:18:55.320
It's her confidence that makes it all the more devastating.

00:18:55.320 --> 00:18:56.740
I guess so.

00:18:56.740 --> 00:18:59.610
Oh, you were waiting for me?

00:18:59.610 --> 00:19:03.030
Yep! Ako-chan, you were amazing out there.

00:19:03.030 --> 00:19:05.540
Seriously, you had me entranced.

00:19:05.540 --> 00:19:09.370
When I get even slightly serious, that much is to be expected.

00:19:09.370 --> 00:19:11.630
Spoken like a real member of S4.

00:19:11.630 --> 00:19:16.760
I may have lost to Senpai, but I did claim Theater Class's spot in S4 as my own.

00:19:16.760 --> 00:19:20.010
I suppose you could call that an acceptable result.

00:19:20.010 --> 00:19:22.430
Congratulations on S4, Ako-chan.

00:19:22.430 --> 00:19:26.600
Thanks. But Yume, you can't afford to concern yourself with me.

00:19:26.600 --> 00:19:29.310
Song Class is projected to be a warzone.{oh man, so many semantic arguments about prediction vs projection on baseball internet}{oh my}

00:19:29.310 --> 00:19:32.190
You're telling me. I even have Rola to worry about.

00:19:32.190 --> 00:19:33.770
That gets me going!

00:19:33.770 --> 00:19:35.940
You'll get to have your rival match.

00:19:35.940 --> 00:19:37.110
Saotome.

00:19:38.400 --> 00:19:39.690
Senpai.

00:19:48.080 --> 00:19:49.330
It's all over.

00:19:49.330 --> 00:19:50.330
Yes.

00:19:53.040 --> 00:19:56.130
Congratulations on remaining at the top of Theater Class.

00:19:56.130 --> 00:20:01.340
Thank you. Congratulations on becoming part of S4 too.

00:20:01.340 --> 00:20:03.510
Right, I'll do my best.

00:20:05.970 --> 00:20:06.760
Here.

00:20:07.350 --> 00:20:09.220
Reward Time.

00:20:17.020 --> 00:20:20.240
I was unable to win against you in the end.

00:20:20.570 --> 00:20:25.280
I wanted to give you a fitting sendoff in your final year.

00:20:25.280 --> 00:20:31.500
It was the same for me. Winning was my way of demonstrating how to properly lead your juniors.

00:20:31.960 --> 00:20:35.540
But because this was our final showdown...

00:20:35.540 --> 00:20:38.920
I won today, but there's no telling what might happen next time.{why you do this}{so that too many sentences don't start off the same}

00:20:38.920 --> 00:20:40.510
Huh, next time?

00:20:40.510 --> 00:20:44.380
Yeah. It's not as if we'll never face each other again.

00:20:44.380 --> 00:20:47.260
The S4 Selection isn't the only battlefield out there.

00:20:49.760 --> 00:20:54.940
We may be graduating from school, 
but we won't be graduating from being idols.

00:20:54.940 --> 00:20:58.900
A time will come when we can compete on the stage once more.

00:21:01.860 --> 00:21:05.530
Senpai, when next we face off on stage...

00:21:07.160 --> 00:21:11.410
I'm looking forward to it. 
Let's face each other at full power again.

00:21:11.910 --> 00:21:12.750
Yes!

00:21:32.390 --> 00:21:36.810
Subaru-kyun, I ended up losing.

00:21:36.810 --> 00:21:40.820
"Yeah, I know. But you still made S4, didn't you?"

00:21:40.820 --> 00:21:43.240
Yes, naturally!

00:21:49.700 --> 00:21:56.160
But I... I really... wanted to win!

00:22:00.090 --> 00:22:03.260
Ako-chan was putting on a brave face for us.

00:22:03.260 --> 00:22:05.590
Isn't that why we're holding this pity party? {I used this somewhere in the last 6-12 months, but I can't remember where}{it's a good}

00:22:05.590 --> 00:22:06.340
Yeah...

00:22:11.220 --> 00:22:12.350
Ako-chan...

00:22:13.470 --> 00:22:16.690
We should probably give her some space tonight.

00:22:16.690 --> 00:22:17.850
Right.

00:22:19.190 --> 00:22:21.770
Tomorrow will be my turn.

00:24:10.880 --> 00:24:13.840
Our senpai in S4 are all so strong!

00:24:13.840 --> 00:24:17.640
Next up is my turn. I'm going to beat Onee-chan!

00:24:17.640 --> 00:24:19.930
Next time on Aikatsu Stars!

00:24:19.930 --> 00:24:21.850
Battle of the Kasumi Sisters.

00:24:21.850 --> 00:24:24.350
Become the first-star idol!
